Install-ReleaseApp 't1m0thyj/WinDynamicDesktop' "^WinDynamicDesktop_.+_$arch`_Setup\.exe$" 'WinDynamicDesktop*' '/VERYSILENT /SUPPRESSMSGBOXES /NORESTART /SP- /TASKS="registerddw"' $false

